  "id": "dop",
  "term": "DOP",
  "definition": "DOP stands for differential outcomes procedure, a learning method in which different correct responses are linked to different specific rewards. It is used to strengthen discriminative learning and recognition memory by building expectations about the outcome tied to each response.",
